<title>SINGAPORE: Winfoong ups Hong Fok stake.</title>
<headline>Winfoong ups Hong Fok stake.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>HongKong's Winfoong Holdings Ltd has increased its stake in Singapore construction group Hong Fok Corp Ltd, said a Hong Fok statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In a declaration to the Stock Exchange of Singapore, it said Winfoong bought 800,000 shares on the open market in two blocks at Singapore $3.09 and S$3.13 on April 25.</p>
<p>After the purchase, Winfoong's stake in Hong Fok stood at 8.22 percent or 11.23 million shares.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
